      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f6e6e0fb2850a1b2cc0bd37|full_name}: Tupper mentioned about the fact that implementing links into the bio in-app would be \"spookier\" which is understandable given the potential for risk involved. The ROI being too heavy honestly. In their words, \n\"honestly we'll probably eventually drop links in favor of like... (put your twitter/discord/whatever name here)\nlinks are too scary tbh\"\n\"investment: a pretty huge security risk\nreturn: ???????????????? links i guess???????????\"\nThere would need to be a lot of review over how to implement something like that carefully because of the security risk involved.",
