      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it might even make sense to display this information as upfront as to be in the nameplate, next to the status or something. This is information you want to skim before even starting a conversation. \nHaving it very upfront might be good, for instance for the non-English-speaking minorities in the community, raising awareness that not everyone will be able to respond when spoken to in English.",
